  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health sector budget supp - Monitoring and evaluation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">H&#xE4;lsosektorbudgetst&#xF6;d</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Icke-&#xF6;ronm&#xE4;rkt sektorbudgetst&#xF6;d till genomf&#xF6;randet av landets h&#xE4;lsosektorplan, Health Sector Strategic Plan, HSSP II, 2005/06-2009/10 och uppf&#xF6;ljaren HSSIP 2010/11-2014/15. Avtalet inneh&#xE5;ller &#xE4;ven st&#xF6;d till h&#xE4;lso SWAPens Partnership Fund upp till slutet av 2009 samt s&#xE4;rskilt avsatta medel f&#xF6;r uppf&#xF6;ljning och utv&#xE4;rdering kopplat till HSSP II och HSSIP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Un-earmarked sector budget support to the implementation of the Health Sector Strategic Plan, HSSP II, 2005/06-2009/10 and the follow-up HSSIP, 2010/11-2014/15. The contribution also includes support to the Health SWAp Partnership Fund until 2009 and specific funds earmarked for M&amp;E initiatives within the framework of HSSP.</narrative>
  </description>
